Because zero is merely a value assigned to an element that still remains inside the domain.

20:40.860 --> 20:50.840
If you assign a zero probability to the backpack being on the living room floor, the concept of the backpack is still on your menu of possibilities for that room.

20:51.180 --> 20:53.920
