20:57.620 --> 21:04.040
Operator A happens if when you turn on the light, the thing sitting on your rug is something so utterly alien.

21:04.040 --> 21:12.260
Let's say it's a glowing, floating, gelatinous orb of purple plasma, that you have absolutely no antecedent category for it.

